<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.census.counts ~ what a stop would drop, counted before it happens

`lares vessel census` asks the custody door's census frame and each island's shore census for saves held in memory and carriers the projector owes, plus untracked files under a checkout's mirror; each item names the act that lands it. `docs=true` reads the document census instead: every stored document, its class and who names it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ census · docs

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`census` params=`~ what a stop would drop`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`docs` params=`docs/true ~ the document census`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ docs

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`docs` params=`kind/switch ~ read every stored document, its class and who names it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ runs on this host's own vessel root; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

