```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`census-unanswered` params=`~ a line could not answer; named, never read clean`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel stands locked`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

